## Community documentation

`docs/NTT Modding Cheat Sheet.md` is a community-written Nuclear Throne
Together reference exported from a public Google Doc. It names no author and
states no license; it is included for reference, is not covered by the MIT
grant above, and is excluded from the packaged extension.
